"Select the correct Bloch vector that represents the state $|\\Psi\\rangle = "
"\\sqrt{\\frac{1}{3}}|0\\rangle + e^{i \\pi / 4} "
"\\sqrt{\\frac{2}{3}}|1\\rangle$ :\n"
msgstr ""
"Piliin ang tamang Bloch vector na kumakatawan sa estado $|\\Psi\\rangle = "
"\\sqrt{\\frac{1}{3}}|0\\rangle + e^{i \\pi / 4} "
"\\sqrt{\\frac{2}{3}}|1\\rangle$:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Four Bloch spheres are shown. The vector points nearly along +x in option "
"a, halfway between +x and +y and slightly below the xy plane in option b, "
"between +x and -y, and slightly above the xy plane in option c, and along -x"
" in option d. ](/learning/images/modules/quantum-mechanics/superposition-"
"with-qiskit/mc-question.avif)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Four Bloch spheres are shown. The vector points nearly along +x in option "
"a, halfway between +x and +y and slightly below the xy plane in option b, "
"between +x and -y, and slightly above the xy plane in option c, and along -x"
" in option d. ](/learning/images/modules/quantum-mechanics/superposition-"
"with-qiskit/mc-question.avif)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The Bloch sphere describes a qubit's:\n"
"(select all that apply)\n"
msgstr ""
"Inilalarawan ng Bloch sphere ang mga sumusunod na katangian ng isang qubit:\n"
"(piliin ang lahat ng naaangkop)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "   a. amplitude\n"
msgstr "   a. amplitude\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "   b. entanglement with other qubits\n"
msgstr "   b. entanglement sa ibang mga qubit\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "   c. phase\n"
msgstr "   c. phase\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "   d. color\n"
msgstr "   d. kulay\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "   e. probability of measurement outcomes\n"
msgstr "   e. posibilidad ng mga resulta ng pagsukat\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Discussion questions: {#discussion-questions}"
msgstr "Mga tanong para sa talakayan: {#discussion-questions}"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Why can the state of a qubit be visualized on the Bloch sphere, but the "
"probability distribution of a coin flip cannot?\n"
msgstr ""
"Bakit maaaring ma-visualize ang estado ng isang qubit sa Bloch sphere, "
"ngunit ang probability distribution ng isang paghagis ng barya ay hindi?\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Why is a coin flipping in the air not the best analogy to a quantum "
"superposition state? What aspect of superpositions are not captured in this "
"analogy?\n"
msgstr ""
"Bakit ang isang barya na lumiligid sa hangin ay hindi ang pinakamahusay na "
"analohiya sa isang quantum superposition state? Anong aspeto ng mga "
"superposition ang hindi nakuha sa analohiyang ito?\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Challenge problems: {#challenge-problems}"
msgstr "Mga hamon na problema: {#challenge-problems}"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Use Qiskit to create a circuit that transforms the state $|0\\rangle$ to the"
" state $\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}|0\\rangle + \\frac{1}{2}e^{i "
"\\frac{5\\pi}{6}}|1\\rangle$\n"
msgstr ""
"Gamitin ang Qiskit upang lumikha ng circuit na nagbabago ng estado "
"$|0\\rangle$ sa estado $\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}|0\\rangle + \\frac{1}{2}e^{i "
"\\frac{5\\pi}{6}}|1\\rangle$\n"
